type enlng

remember words as split "a,b,c" by ","
show words
show join words with "-"
remember nums as [4, 8, 15, 16, 23, 42]
show sum of nums
show max of nums
show nums[0] nums[2]
nums[1] = 100
show nums
sort nums descending
show nums
reverse nums
show nums
remember total as 0
for each v in nums:
    total increases by v
show total
remember t as 0
while t < 3:
    t increases by 1
show t
